# Tax Authority forms — only commit blank public-domain templates,
# never signed/scanned versions (they contain Asaf's ID, signature,
# and personal details). The 2 blank PDFs already committed are fine;
# signed scans dropped here will be auto-excluded.
Rashot Hamisim/**/*signed*
Rashot Hamisim/**/*חתום*
Rashot Hamisim/**/*scan*
Rashot Hamisim/**/*סרוק*
Rashot Hamisim/**/*filled*
Rashot Hamisim/**/*מולא*
.gstack/

# Local-only working docs. THIS REPO IS PUBLIC, and each of these directories
# holds material that must never leave the machine:
#   docs/tax-authority/  — SIGNED Tax Authority forms (ID number, signature) plus
#                          the registration package with personal contact details
#   docs/payments/       — clearing-company onboarding notes with personal
#                          identifiers (email, phone) and KYC instructions
#   docs/marketing/      — GTM planning that includes Asaf's home address, phone,
#                          email and a real Tax Authority allocation number
docs/tax-authority/
docs/payments/
docs/marketing/

# local audit / scratch artifacts
audit.json
tmp_audit_local.json

# QA / design screenshots (local only)
design-shots/

.vercel
.env*

# backup script output (local runs)
backup-out/
*.tar.gz.enc

# one-shot session marker written by a local agent, not project state
.domain-delegation-announced
